.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBauro plugin install\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-endpoint\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-start\fR] [\fB\-\-ca\-cert\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
